hi,
this may sound redundant, but i have installed Deducer and JGR following the tips provided in r-interface.blogspot.com.au <http://r-interface.blogspot.com.au>. when i start JGR and it seems to be working fine, a pop-up window says "This R process is taking some time. Would you like to canel it?" (attached). and there is nothing one can do to get rid off it.

i am running ubuntu 13.04
R version 3.0.2 (2013-09-25) -- "Frisbee Sailing"
the java sdk files are fine, no errors with r CMD javarconf

if anyone has any idea, or has come across this issue before?
many thanks,
alan

